cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this study, please cite it as below."
title: "Causal-Aware, Machine-Learning-Driven, Factor-Informed Risk Forecasting: A Python Pipeline Integrating NLP, Directed Factor Constraints, and Portfolio Analytics"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible Python and Azure pipeline that evaluates whether a small,
  manually specified Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG), used as a lightweight
  information-flow governance layer over a machine-learning risk-forecasting
  pipeline, improves out-of-sample forecast accuracy, portfolio risk control,
  and interpretability relative to unconstrained baseline models across a
  14-ETF universe.
type: software
